ssing dependencies that are referenced directly by the opening scene. Therefore, if the missing dependency is deeply nested, manually fixing it becomes cumbersome. I guess this is the main reason we devote to improving automatic solutions. However, there are situations where manual fixing is inevitable.\r\n\r\nThis PR lists all missing items related to the current scene in the Dependency Errors dialog. It also allows the user to open the corresponding dependency editing dialog directly from this dialog, so that they don't have to manually locate them one by one in the file system.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4e6f8d9-d28d-45da-81bf-5645ecf4e5fb\r\n\r\nNote: Ideally, fixing one missing resource should ideally fix all references to it automatically. However, this would involve a complete refactoring of the dependency editing dialog. I think that could be a separate PR.\r\n\r\nTest project with several missing dependencies: [deps-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20751796/deps-mrp.zip)\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12681","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-16T07:30:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:07Z","closed_at":"2025-11-04T22:22:50Z","merged_at":null,"merg